flowchart TD
    subgraph P0["Phase 0 - Stabilize, Antigravity run"]
        C[Canonical pages docs/source]
        GEN[Generation scripts with fixture default]
        GATES[Deterministic gates - schema, planes, hashes, citations, MDX restriction, link allowlist, secret scan, visibility]
        EV[PROGRESS.md evidence log and VALIDATION.md]
    end

    subgraph P1["Phase 1 - Deployable and governed"]
        GH[GitHub repository - human creates and pushes]
        CI[ci.yml - validate, test, detect, build, path guard]
        PR[docs-gen branch and bot PR with run report]
        APR[Human approval record and code-owner review]
        PUB[publish.yml - production build to GitHub Pages via OIDC]
    end

    subgraph P2["Phase 2 - Live generation"]
        RT[Router - fixture first, private to local only]
        AD[Adapters with structured output, retry, budget]
        LV[Local schema validation and grounding gate]
        OWN[Live smoke call - owner executed]
    end

    subgraph P3["Phase 3 - External evidence, spec only"]
        EXT[Pinned external repo snapshots - repo, commit, path, hash]
    end

    C --> GEN
    GEN --> GATES
    GATES --> EV
    EV -->|Phase 0 checkpoint| GH
    GH --> CI
    CI --> PR
    PR --> APR
    APR --> PUB
    PUB --> R[Readers EN and HU - static site, no AI at read time]
    GEN --> RT
    RT --> AD
    AD --> LV
    LV --> PR
    OWN -.->|keys and spend caps held by owner| AD
    EXT -.->|owner decision NV-SUP-2| GEN
    C -->|source hashes| D[detect - stale set]
    D -->|executable regeneration plan| GEN
